<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">F-Fox...?</font>

55
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a battle...</font>

56
00:03:01,610 --> 00:03:04,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't call this place safe either, huh...</font>

57
00:03:04,950 --> 00:03:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

58
00:03:06,990 --> 00:03:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His power is increasing
more and more!</font>

59
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chief! We got to hurry up and rouse
that guy out of his sleep!</font>

60
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that!</font>

61
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:23,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here goes...!</font>

62
00:03:27,770 --> 00:03:28,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go to hell!</font>

63
00:03:44,450 --> 00:03:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Now!</font>

64
00:03:46,950 --> 00:03:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

65
00:03:53,370 --> 00:03:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wake the hell up!</font>

66
00:04:00,260 --> 00:04:01,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk...</font>

67
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:03,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

68
00:04:03,550 --> 00:04:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not that much time has passed
since the medium went to sleep!</font>

69
00:04:06,470 --> 00:04:09,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that state,
one blow should be enough!</font>

70
00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:13,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

71
00:04:13,770 --> 00:04:17,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It hasn't been long since I emerged!</font>

72
00:04:19,650 --> 00:04:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Jutsu has been dissolved!</font>

73
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if the Playing Possum Jutsu
is dissolved,</font>

74
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:30,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's still putting on the pressure?</font>

75
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy interfered with my Jutsu...?!</font>

76
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:48,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Coffin!</font>

77
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:50,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Pop!
— Yeah!</font>

78
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the chief's tongue...</font>

79
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:55,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't take me for a fool!</font>

80
00:05:06,450 --> 00:05:07,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

81
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:11,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of strength
does this guy possess?</font>

82
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:13,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This doesn't look good...!</font>

83
00:05:13,450 --> 00:05:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both Naruto and I have already
completely disgorged our Chakra!</font>

84
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:25,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will be killed by me!
I will not cease to exist!</font>

85
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricanes!</font>

86
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides just the Sound Ninja,
I wouldn't have imagined that</font>

87
00:05:46,070 --> 00:05:49,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this many of the Sand Jonin
would enter into the village, too!</font>

88
00:05:49,530 --> 00:05:54,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's understandable.
This is what is called war.</font>

89
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's taking much too long.</font>

90
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:03,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible for a battle
between Shinobi to last this long.</font>

91
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:06,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is happening inside?</font>

92
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:22,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're still grabbing my arm...</font>

93
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't use my Jutsu this way...</font>

94
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:28,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on,
let go of me once and for all.</font>

95
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not letting your ambitions
interfere with the village... any longer...</font>

96
00:06:44,130 --> 00:06:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no stopping my ambitions!
You will die here!</font>

97
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:52,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You old bastard...</font>

98
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As the Third Hokage,</font>

99
00:06:54,810 --> 00:06:59,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are you saying you still have
the power to save this village?</font>

100
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you understand...
the current situation?!</font>

101
00:07:11,610 --> 00:07:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Many Hidden Sand Shinobi and
my subordinates</font>

102
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have infiltrated this village.</font>

103
00:07:28,550 --> 00:07:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your side... the Leaf Shinobi...</font>

104
00:07:32,050 --> 00:07:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will be annihilated down to
every last woman and child!</font>

105
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:39,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will accomplish the destruction
of the Hidden Leaf Village!</font>

106
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's empty inside!</font>

107
00:07:54,410 --> 00:07:55,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nobody there!</font>

108
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's very strange...</font>

109
00:07:57,490 --> 00:07:58,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

110
00:07:58,740 --> 00:08:01,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is there so little resistance
when we've closed in</font>

111
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:04,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all the way to the center
of the Hidden Leaf Village?</font>

112
00:08:05,080 --> 00:08:06,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

113
00:08:06,210 --> 00:08:10,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also... there's not one woman
or child in sight.</font>

114
00:08:10,670 --> 00:08:12,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is the reason for that?</font>

115
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

116
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-kun...?</font>

117
00:08:31,070 --> 00:08:33,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Konohamaru-chan?</font>

118
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gotta use the toilet.</font>

119
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-Me too...</font>

120
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:40,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I do too...</font>

121
00:08:47,330 --> 00:08:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">K-Konohamaru...!</font>

122
00:08:51,210 --> 00:08:53,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is an emergency situation!</font>

123
00:08:53,170 --> 00:08:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the enemy finds us,
it will cost us!</font>

124
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go back to the other room
and stay quiet!</font>

125
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:03,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It's not that... I gotta pee!</font>

126
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

127
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:08,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think I can hold it...</font>

128
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:14,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break.
In that case, come along with me...</font>

129
00:09:15,070 --> 00:09:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't hold it!</font>

130
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't! Can't hold...!</font>

131
00:10:00,950 --> 00:10:01,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

132
00:10:02,830 --> 00:10:04,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At last, huh...</font>

133
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:19,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get revenge for you
no matter what...</font>

134
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hayate.</font>

135
00:10:25,930 --> 00:10:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the signal. Let's go!</font>

136
00:10:27,690 --> 00:10:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roger!</font>

137
00:10:38,780 --> 00:10:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't get it, do you, Orochimaru?</font>

138
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:49,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't underestimate the Shinobi
of this Village!</font>

139
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right?</font>

140
00:10:58,170 --> 00:10:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

141
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:01,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that... the last?</font>

142
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:03,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, the evacuation is complete!</font>

143
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's happening?</font>

144
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:10,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Leaves
has an instruction manual</font>

145
00:11:10,350 --> 00:11:12,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">outlining what to do in case of
a sneak attack by the enemy.</font>

146
00:11:12,730 --> 00:11:16,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Step One:
Eliminate the enemy's sneak attack force.</font>

147
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In case one is unable
to eliminate them,</font>

148
00:11:19,860 --> 00:11:22,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">proceed immediately to Step Two.</font>

149
00:11:23,070 --> 00:11:25,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The immediate evacuation
of noncombatants!</font>

150
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:30,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Evacuate the women and children
to shelters around the village!</font>

151
00:11:31,500 --> 00:11:34,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When that has been completed,
proceed to Step Three!</font>

152
00:11:34,670 --> 00:11:36,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Step Three...?</font>

153
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Through the collective strength
and efforts of the Village,</font>

154
00:11:38,710 --> 00:11:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">eliminate the enemy!</font>

155
00:11:40,380 --> 00:11:41,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...!</font>

156
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The counteroffensive... starts now!</font>

157
00:11:57,650 --> 00:12:00,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will not allow you to take
even one step beyond this point!</font>

158
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:17,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

159
00:12:18,710 --> 00:12:22,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rescue Sakura,
if it's the last thing you do!</font>

160
00:12:23,220 --> 00:12:26,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll protect Sakura-chan no matter what!</font>

161
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will be killed by me.
I will not cease to exist.</font>

162
00:12:39,940 --> 00:12:41,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My back is against the wall...</font>

163
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:43,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to hurry up
and stop that Demon Raccoon...</font>

164
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please...</font>

165
00:12:49,370 --> 00:12:51,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a small amount is fine...</font>

166
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me...</font>

167
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">some Chakra!</font>

168
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:34,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing...?
There's only one opponent!</font>

169
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:49,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hyuga is the magnum force
of the Leaf Village.</font>

170
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't forget that!</font>

171
00:13:54,140 --> 00:13:58,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-My... body... is immobilized...</font>

172
00:14:00,230 --> 00:14:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this the first time
you're experiencing</font>

173
00:14:02,150 --> 00:14:04,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Leaf's hidden technique,
Shadow Paralysis Jutsu?</font>

174
00:14:04,940 --> 00:14:07,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, take this too while I'm at it...</font>

175
00:14:08,610 --> 00:14:12,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf's hidden technique...
Shadow Strangle Jutsu!</font>

176
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Expansion Jutsu!</font>

177
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind Destruction Jutsu!</font>

178
00:14:32,510 --> 00:14:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's this?!</font>

179
00:14:34,390 --> 00:14:36,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body is... all on its own...!</font>

180
00:14:36,140 --> 00:14:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop...</font>

181
00:14:38,060 --> 00:14:39,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

182
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reminds me of the old days!</font>

183
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:49,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

184
00:14:50,450 --> 00:14:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The original Ino-Shika-Cho Trio reunites!</font>

185
00:14:58,660 --> 00:15:00,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kuromaru... let's go!</font>

186
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:01,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

187
00:15:02,330 --> 00:15:03,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to protect the village,</font>

188
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:08,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all the Leaf Shinobi will risk
their lives fighting!</font>

189
00:15:10,510 --> 00:15:17,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Real strength doesn't lie
in the mastering of all Jutsu!</font>

190
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:22,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The poison in my body is...</font>

191
00:15:23,060 --> 00:15:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't move, Shino.
I inserted my Parasitic Insects.</font>

192
00:15:27,190 --> 00:15:28,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are removing the poison.</font>

193
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad...</font>

194
00:15:32,610 --> 00:15:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe I taught this
to you too, in the past...</font>

195
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:38,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is when one protects
someone important...</font>

196
00:15:39,160 --> 00:15:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the true strength of
the Shinobi will emerge!</font>

197
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:48,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will protect everyone!</font>

198
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:55,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I come! You idiot raccoon!</font>

199
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die...!</font>

200
00:16:02,900 --> 00:16:03,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

201
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:07,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

202
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:36,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Did he win...?</font>

203
00:16:37,890 --> 00:16:39,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A simple head blow...</font>

204
00:16:39,890 --> 00:16:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His manner of fighting
is incredibly clumsy,</font>

205
00:16:42,730 --> 00:16:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to think that he could squeeze out
Chakra at that critical stage.</font>

206
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen a knucklehead Ninja
like him before, but...</font>

207
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:54,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he sure is the first phenomenal kid
I've seen in a long time.</font>

208
00:16:56,070 --> 00:16:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too bad that I can't see this through
to the end,</font>

209
00:16:59,870 --> 00:17:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I've reached my limit.</font>

210
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:05,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gamakichi, let's head home!</font>

211
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:07,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Pop!</font>

212
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As might be expected, even I...
am empty now...</font>

213
00:17:40,620 --> 00:17:42,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are too, aren't you?</font>

214
00:17:42,870 --> 00:17:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're much alike...
let's make this time the last!</font>

215
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears that...</font>

216
00:17:53,880 --> 00:18:00,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have the strength left
to yank out your entire soul.</font>

217
00:18:02,100 --> 00:18:05,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, your ambition ends here!</font>

218
00:18:05,980 --> 00:18:06,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet!</font>

219
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:09,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no stopping my ambition!</font>

220
00:18:10,190 --> 00:18:11,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a suitable punishment for you</font>

221
00:18:11,940 --> 00:18:17,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who have become addicted to the Jutsu
and who have overindulged in the Jutsu!</font>

222
00:18:17,570 --> 00:18:21,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will take all your Jutsu away with me!</font>

223
00:18:21,370 --> 00:18:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

224
00:18:30,170 --> 00:18:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

225
00:18:31,630 --> 00:18:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me that..?</font>

226
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop that!</font>

227
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seal!</font>

228
00:18:49,230 --> 00:18:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My... My arms...</font>

229
00:18:54,690 --> 00:18:58,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... you can no longer use
either of your arms.</font>

230
00:18:59,030 --> 00:19:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And since you can't use your arms,
you can't weave Signs.</font>

231
00:19:03,870 --> 00:19:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You no longer possess Ninjutsu!</font>

232
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:14,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your ambition of crushing
the Hidden Leaf... dies right here!</font>

233
00:19:14,630 --> 00:19:18,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You old bastard!
Give me back my arms!</font>

234
00:19:19,470 --> 00:19:22,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru, you fool...</font>

235
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:25,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unfortunate that
we can't leave together,</font>

236
00:19:26,260 --> 00:19:27,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but, my disciple...</font>

237
00:19:29,100 --> 00:19:32,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">let's meet in the other world one day.</font>

238
00:19:32,100 --> 00:19:34,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You old bastard...
whose life is hanging by a thread!</font>

239
00:19:34,190 --> 00:19:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare you!
How dare you take away my Jutsu!</font>

240
00:20:00,420 --> 00:20:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In places where the Leaf dances,
a fire burns...</font>

241
00:20:09,730 --> 00:20:12,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The shadow of the fire
will illuminate the Village...</font>

242
00:20:34,460 --> 00:20:37,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And once more the Leaf will sprout...</font>

243
00:21:10,590 --> 00:21:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

244
00:21:10,590 --> 00:21:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

245
00:21:15,550 --> 00:21:20,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

246
00:21:15,550 --> 00:21:20,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

247
00:21:20,600 --> 00:21:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

248
00:21:20,600 --> 00:21:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

249
00:21:28,650 --> 00:21:31,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">wakiyaku dakedo</font></font></b></font>

250
00:21:28,650 --> 00:21:31,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">it's a secondary role</font></font></b></font>

251
00:21:34,460 --> 00:21:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kage no hito dakedo</font></font></b></font>

252
00:21:34,460 --> 00:21:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a role in the shadows</font></font></b></font>

253
00:21:37,860 --> 00:21:42,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume to mukiau toki kurai</font></font></b></font>

254
00:21:37,860 --> 00:21:42,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but in reaching for that dream</font></font></b></font>

255
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">man naka ni isasete shoujiki ni isasete</font></font></b></font>

256
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">let us stay centered, let us stay true</font></font></b></font>

257
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:53,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo nan toka akiramezu ni</font></font></b></font>

258
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:53,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we hung on without giving up</font></font></b></font>

259
00:21:53,610 --> 00:21:58,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo tachi agatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

260
00:21:53,610 --> 00:21:58,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we kept coming back up</font></font></b></font>

261
00:21:58,310 --> 00:22:00,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo</font></font></b></font>

262
00:21:58,310 --> 00:22:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we believed and dreamed</font></font></b></font>

263
00:22:00,620 --> 00:22:01,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">bokura</font></font></b></font>

264
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

265
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">shinjite</font></font></b></font>

266
00:22:04,150 --> 00:22:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

267
00:22:05,490 --> 00:22:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume mite nandomo</font></font></b></font>

268
00:22:08,430 --> 00:22:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo baka o mite kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

269
00:22:08,430 --> 00:22:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've seen fools</font></font></b></font>

270
00:22:13,630 --> 00:22:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo hito no kage ni tatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

271
00:22:13,630 --> 00:22:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've stood in the shadows of others</font></font></b></font>

272
00:22:20,670 --> 00:22:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">saa shuyaku da yo jibun no yume kurai wagamama de isasete</font></font></b></font>

273
00:22:20,670 --> 00:22:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">now, it's our turn... let us bask in our dreams</font></font></b></font>

274
00:22:38,620 --> 00:22:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Third Hokage-sama...</font>

275
00:22:40,420 --> 00:22:43,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">The ambition that you had
seems to have been passed on</font>

276
00:22:43,210 --> 00:22:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">to the young Shinobi
in the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

277
